{
  "label": "endofgameworld",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label endofgameworld:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gameworld1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gameworld1.webp",
      "alt": "gameworld1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The time has come for me to save my family. I will complete my journey and defeat the final boss of Sensei-Quest.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if kyotoevent == False:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ kyotomiss = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei’s HP has increased to 50!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That would have been really helpful like four boss fights ago.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "With a head full of hopes and dreams, our brave hero sets off toward Meowri’s house.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In the final version of the game, a forty-five minute cutscene depicting his journey will be shown here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene finalbosstime1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/finalbosstime1.webp",
      "alt": "finalbosstime1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For now, please accept this picture of a binturong.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the hell is a binturong?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "SENSEIDEX: The binturong, also known as a bearcat, is a carnivorous mammal native to south and southeast Asia. Their status in the wild is currently assessed as “vulnerable.”",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Since when do I have a Senseidex and why is the only entry in it an endangered animal?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "SENSEIDEX: Correction — the binturong is not “endangered.” It is currently “vulnerable,” as previously mentioned. Please pay attention, idiot.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And why is it so rude?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "After the forty-five minute walk to Meowri’s house concludes, Sensei knocks on Meowri’s door and prepares himself to leave a survey detailing how he thinks the Shiawase Group can improve Sensei-Quest!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Please note that Sensei will receive 50 RAINBOW COINS for completing this survey!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’ve already passed the point of no return. What am I even supposed to do with those now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You can use them in new game plus — where all encounters are ten times harder with mild variations.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh god no.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene finalbosstime2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/finalbosstime2.webp",
      "alt": "finalbosstime2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei has arrived at Meowri’s House!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is a McDonald’s.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene finalbosstime3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/finalbosstime3.webp",
      "alt": "finalbosstime3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello again, brave hero! Did you enjoy your journey?",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? Why not?",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably because like 95%% of enemy attacks dealt the same amount of damage while my attacks needed to be made in an extremely specific order with no logic to it whatsoever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The boss health bars never moved, I could never see what my HP or PREMIUM CURRENCY levels were, there were only two vendors and three BGM tracks, and like all of the non-boss enemies were slimes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your feedback has been recorded!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please accept these 50 RAINBOW COINS as thanks for playing Sensei-Quest!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want all of my time back. No one told me I was going to have to beat an entire RPG just to get on with the Halloween update.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s that? You’re ready to beat the game? Why didn’t you just say so?!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Meowri has removed the Four Orbs of Power from Sensei’s inventory!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! I worked really hard for those!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You sure did! But in order to face the final boss, we need to take them to a special location that only I know about and perform a secret summoning ritual.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can we not just summon the boss inside this McDonald’s? I’ve been surviving off of Greenis bits for weeks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ll be able to eat real food once you defeat the final boss!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And also, if you die, you have to start the whole game all over.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have to what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yup! So be really careful to not make any mistakes!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or just save the game. That works too, I guess.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m never playing another Shiawase Group game for as long as I live.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That just means you can play more Sensei-Quest!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please, anything but that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Meowri and Sensei exit Meowri’s house before Meowri transforms into a car!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ??????????",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t ask questions! Just get in!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei enters Meowri, but in a way that provides no sexual pleasure to him whatsoever!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He takes his place in the middle section of the backseat (which does not have a seatbelt) because he is very daring and brave and also kind of weird.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am a force to be reckoned with.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene frown",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/frown.png",
      "alt": "frown"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But then Meowri is T-boned by another vehicle and Sensei takes 50 damage!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene clownguy",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/clownguy.webp",
      "alt": "clownguy"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei has died!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theend",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/theend.png",
      "alt": "theend"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thanks for playing Sensei-Quest!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gameworld20x",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gameworld20x.webp",
      "alt": "gameworld20x"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just a little more...",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aaaand...",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Done!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Are you still with me?",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come on! Wake up!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gameworld20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gameworld20.webp",
      "alt": "gameworld20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mm...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei has revived!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Meowri?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What happened?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We were in a terrible accident! I had to rewrite the game’s ending just to bring you back.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How do you feel?",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like I just died.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you did just die. But you’re okay now! Or at least...you need to hurry up and get okay. The final boss will be appearing any second now.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei gazes up at Meowri. A small sphere hovers and pulsates several inches above her hands, which are currently clasped together as if to receive the Eucharist.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is that thing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A new beginning.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It is at that moment that Sensei realizes what the sphere is — the Four Orbs of Power fused together into the Ancient Orb.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is the final boss. This is what you must defeat if you ever want to see your family again.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s what you must defeat if you ever want to see anything again.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is a dark entity within each and every one of us — and this one is yours.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The sphere begins to rapidly expand in size. Meowri takes a step back as it now hovers on its own, without what little assistance her hands provided before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good luck, hero.",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The final battle begins now!",
      "spk": "Meowri",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gameworld21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gameworld21.webp",
      "alt": "gameworld21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb appeared!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label orbfight:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if senseidamage > 50:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t do it...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb peers deep into Sensei’s soul, but there is no life left in him to drain.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei collapses to the ground, scared and confused.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb does not move. But as Sensei begins to fade away, he can faintly make out the sounds of whispers bleeding from the dark entity’s center.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "“Believe...in...God...”",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But is that what the whispers are actually commanding? Or is that just what he expects to hear?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In his final moments, he changes everything about himself.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He becomes a better man.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He finally learns what it is that makes the earth move.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But it is too late for belief alone to change anything.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theend",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/theend.png",
      "alt": "theend"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei dies!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "return",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump orbfightmenu",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu orbfightmenu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Attack",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tackle",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei used Tackle!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "His blow is absorbed by the endless void before him.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb peers deep into Sensei’s soul! It eats away at his mind!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei takes 20 damage!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ senseidamage += 20",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump orbfight",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Venom Spit",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei used Venom Spit!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if orbkillpts == 0:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "His venom pierces The Orb’s outer shell.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It is uncertain whether it had any effect...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb gazes deep into Sensei’s soul!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ orbkillpts += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump orbfight",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "His blow is absorbed by the endless void before him.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb peers deep into Sensei’s soul! It eats away at his mind!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei takes 20 damage!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ senseidamage += 20",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump orbfight",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Banana Blast",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sensei used Banana Blast!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if orbkillpts == 2:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb inhales them, inheriting their color for a split second before reverting to its original form.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The Orb gazes deep into Sensei’s soul!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ orbkillpts += 1",
